  "description": {
    "en": "Kirschbaum Gut Feeling is a comfort-oriented multifilament string engineered for maximum arm protection, shock absorption and natural gut-like feel. High-quality fibers and specialized production treatments create a very soft, responsive stringbed with excellent ball pocketing and easy power. It is particularly well suited to recreational players, seniors and players dealing with arm discomfort, while advanced and professional players can also use it as a softer component in hybrid setups. The 1.25 mm version emphasizes feel and power, while the 1.30 mm version offers greater durability and stability.",

    "zh": "Kirschbaum Gut Feeling 是一款以极致舒适、手臂保护和避震性能为核心的多芯球线。高品质纤维配合特殊生产工艺，带来非常柔和、具有高持球感和接近天然肠线的击球反馈，同时能够有效降低手臂负担。它特别适合休闲球员、年长球员以及容易出现手臂不适的球员，高水平球员也可以将其作为 Hybrid 混穿中的柔和横线使用。1.25毫米版本更强调手感和力量；1.30毫米版本则提供更高耐久性和稳定性。"
  },

